he High Seat of Yagnarr","The War Hall of Graktukh","The Great Stockade of Aghnarr","The Drum-Hall of Kulgash","The Great Kraal of Aghzag","The Great Kraal of Yagzad","The War Hall of Kruzdush","The High Seat of Aghtukh","The Great Kraal of Ghordum","The Great Stockade of Ukhzad","The Throne of Aghzuk","The Throne of Ghazgash","The Throne of Kragnakh","The Great Stockade of Kruzuth","The Great Stockade of Gashruz","The Great Kraal of Gnashnarr","The High Seat of Hrukzad","The War Hall of Ragnarr","The Great Kraal of Ghazgor","The Great Stockade of Ghaznarr","The Great Kraal of Rukdum","The Great Stockade of Dagthar","The Drum-Hall of Zharzag","The High Seat of Drognarr","The Great Stockade of Rukakh","The Great Stockade of Kulzad","The War Hall of Kruzrok","The Drum-Hall of Gnashrash","The Moot-Hall of Uznarr","The Moot-Hall of Dagzad","The High Seat of Skarthar","The Great Kraal of Rokzag"]},"descriptions":{"war":["where the war drums beat from dusk till dawn","a ring of hide tents around a roaring bonfire","famous for its boar roasts and its bad singing","where young orcs train with blunt wooden axes","packed up and moved every new moon","guarded by a palisade of sharpened logs","where the warbands gather before the spring raids","where a chieftain settles quarrels with an arm-wrestle","whose banners can be seen from three valleys away","where the wolf-riders keep their packs","set up on the ruins of an old human fort","where the cooking pots never go cold","where scouts come and go at every hour","known for its enormous horn, blown at sunrise","pitched on a hill with a view of every road","where the smiths hammer out axe-heads all night","the last stop before the wild borderlands","where every tent is painted with a warband's tusk-sign","whose chieftain has never lost a wrestling match","where the war boars are fed before the warriors","circled by a ditch, a bank and a lot of shouting","where the shaman reads the smoke each morning","that grows by a few tents every week","where a giant cooking cauldron sits at the heart of camp"],"mountain":["carved into the mountain by a hundred years of digging","whose gate is a giant's skull-shaped cave mouth","reached only by a narrow goat track","that has never been taken by siege","where the forges glow red inside the rock","where the wind howls through the high halls","built on the bones of an old dwarf mine","guarded by trolls who work for food","where the war chief's hall overlooks the clouds","with a great drum that echoes through every tunnel","perched above a gorge too wide for any bridge","whose walls are stacked boulders the size of houses","where the snow never quite melts from the battlements","with tunnels that go deeper than anyone has mapped","where eagles nest on the highest tower","home to the toughest wrestlers in the mountains","where every orc must climb the cliff to be counted a warrior","lit by torches and the glow of the iron mines","a black tooth of rock above the pass","whose gates are opened by a team of six cave bears","where avalanches are rolled down on unwelcome guests","famous for its iron and its terrible weather","the oldest orc hold in the northern peaks","where the clan chiefs meet once in a generation"],"swamp":["a tangle of mud tunnels under the reeds","where the goblins hoard everything shiny","where the frogs are bigger than the guards","home to a goblin king who wears a teapot as a crown","where every tunnel smells of cabbage soup","built from mud, sticks and stolen fence posts","where the cooks serve leech stew on feast days","that floods every spring and nobody minds","where a hundred goblins argue at once","hidden beneath a hill of rotting logs","where the toadstools glow at night","whose only door is a hollow tree stump","where the guards are mostly asleep","famous for its mud-wrestling tournament","where stolen chickens are kept in the throne room","where the tunnels change every time someone digs","linked to the river by a smuggler's ditch","run by a goblin chief with a very loud voice","where travellers lose their boots to the mud","under a bog so deep that horses refuse to cross it","where the midges are the real rulers","that has three front doors and no back door","where every goblin has a pet beetle","whose treasure room is a pile of buttons and spoons"],"ruins":["squatting in a fallen human city","where orcs nap in the old palace's throne room","whose chieftain wears a statue's stone crown","where the old library is now a goat pen","built from the rubble of an elven town","where the cracked fountain is used as a bathtub","where the orcs have kept the old street names, badly","with a giant stone head as its town gate","where the clan sleeps under a roofless cathedral","that the old kingdom still claims on its maps","where the marketplace is open again, sort of","where nobody can read the inscriptions, so they invented their own","where the bell tower is used as a lookout","patched together with doors from a hundred houses","where the orcs hold races in the old arena","once a proud trading city, now a very loud one","where the aqueduct has been turned into a slide","whose walls are painted with tusk-signs over faded murals","where the old mint is now a forge for axe-heads","that every adventurer has tried to win back","where the ivy and the orcs moved in together","whose new name is carved over the old one on the gate","where a dragon lived before the orcs chased it out","where the orc children play in the empty fountains"],"capital":["the great seat of all the orc clans","where the war chief rules from a throne of boar tusks","a sprawl of tents, stockades and stone halls","where every clan has a banner on the great wall","whose market sells everything from wolf saddles to war drums","where a hundred thousand orcs gather for the great moot","built where the first war chief planted his axe","ringed by three walls, each bigger than the last","where challengers wrestle for the right to rule","whose great drum can be heard a day's march away","the largest orc city ever built","where the clans trade, feast and squabble","where the shamans keep the oldest tales of the clans","whose gates are carved with the sign of every clan","where the arena is bigger than most human towns","feared by every kingdom on the border","where the war chief's hall burns with a fire that never goes out","built from the stones of seven conquered forts","where the warbands march out every spring","the beating heart of the orc lands","whose walls have stood for a thousand years","where the great feast lasts for nine days","where envoys from every kingdom wait to be heard","whose towers are topped with enormous tusks"]}}}